---
---

<div class="section bordered subtle-bg">
  <div class="medium center">
    <div class="eyebrow muted">The loop</div>
    <div class="h2">One plan.<br />Every day, different.</div>
    <div class="loop-row">
      <span class="loop-pill">CHECK IN</span>
      <span class="loop-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="loop-pill">GET YOUR WORKOUT</span>
      <span class="loop-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="loop-pill">TRAIN</span>
      <span class="loop-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="loop-pill">CHECK IN</span>
      <span class="loop-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="loop-pill loop-pill-accent">ADAPT</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lede-center">Every workout becomes information for the next one.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .section.bordered {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .section.subtle-bg {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
  }

  .medium {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .eyebrow.muted {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h2 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .loop-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 56px 0 40px;
  }

  .loop-pill {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.14);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .loop-pill-accent {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
  }

  .loop-arrow {
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.3);
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .lede-center {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
